### Get all snippets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/snippets

### Create a new snippet
POST http://localhost:3000/api/snippets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test from VSCode",
  "code": "const test = true;",
  "language": "JavaScript"
}

### Udate snippet by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/snippets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Console logging"
}

### Delete snippet by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/snippets/2
